{
    "title": "Ideas y dise\u00f1o de u\u00f1as bonitas",
    "description": "Do you want to show off beautiful, impeccable and dazzling nails at all times? Then you're about to discover your new beauty companion!\r\n\r\nOur nail design and ideas application is here to turn your manicures into authentic works of art. With thousands of options available for you to choose the ideal manicure or nails on trend for 2023. We help you find the opportunity to explore a world of creativity and style from the comfort of an app.\r\n\r\nWhat can you expect from our app?\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Endless Inspiration: Immerse yourself in an ocean of nail designs ranging from classic to modern. Whether you're looking for an elegant French nail design, geometric patterned nails, or embellished painted nails, you'll find something to suit your unique style.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Step by Step Tutorials [COMING SOON]: It has never been easier to create your own stunning manicures. Our detailed tutorials will guide you through the entire process, from nail prep to applying polish and embellishments. It doesn't matter if you are a beginner or a professional, our tutorials for making gel and semi-permanent ones are for everyone!.\ud83c\udf1f Constant Updates: Every month we update our content so that you have the maximum possible inspiration for your next manicure. Plus, we added more categories so you can find the perfect nail idea. Do you have long, false, semi-permanent, gel or natural nails? Our ideas are suitable for all nail types. Find your category of red, black or white nails, we also have seasons:\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc85Do you want a nail design for Halloween? We have it! Enjoy dozens of Halloween nail designs.\r\n\ud83d\udc85Do you want a nail design for Christmas? We have it! Enjoy hundreds of Christmas nail designs.\r\n\ud83d\udc85Do you want a nail design for Weddings or Events? We have it! You enjoy manicure ideas for weddings or events.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Expert Tips [COMING SOON]: Do you want to know how to make your manicure last longer? How to make sculpted nails from home? Do you have ingrown or fungal nails? We share our secrets with you, from nail prep to applying a long-lasting top coat.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Favorites and Save: Save your favorite designs for future appointments with your manicurist or download the image of the painted nails you like to have them on your phone.\r\n\r\nWith our manicure ideas app, your nails become a blank palette to express your style and creativity. Let your imagination run wild and create a new nail look for every occasion, whether it's a special meeting, a wedding or just a day at work.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc85 In addition, we have designs for all types of manicures:\r\n\r\nIdeas for acrylic nails\r\nIdeas for gel nails\r\nIdeas for long or very long nails (xxl)\r\nIdeas for false nails\r\nIdeas for natural nails\r\nIdeas for short nails\r\nIdeas for semi-permanent nails\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc85And if that were not enough, we have so many categories with inspiration and ideas for manicure that include all this and more:\r\n\r\nDecorated nail designs\r\nFrench nail designs\r\nred nail designs\r\nblack nail designs\r\nWhite nail designs\r\nGreen nail designs\r\nSimple painted nail designs\r\nSculpted nail designs\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc85Remember to change the design according to the season:\r\n\r\nNail manicure for Halloween\r\nNail manicure for Christmas\r\nNail manicure for Valentine's Day\r\nWedding Nail Manicure\r\nNail manicure for baptisms\r\n\r\nDownload our app now and discover the infinite world of possibilities for your nails. Make your nails stand out and set the trend with your unique creations \ud83c\udfa8",
    "descriptionHTML": "Do you want to show off beautiful, impeccable and dazzling nails at all times? Then you&#39;re about to discover your new beauty companion!<br><br>Our nail design and ideas application is here to turn your manicures into authentic works of art. With thousands of options available for you to choose the ideal manicure or nails on trend for 2023. We help you find the opportunity to explore a world of creativity and style from the comfort of an app.<br><br>What can you expect from our app?<br><br>\ud83c\udf1f Endless Inspiration: Immerse yourself in an ocean of nail designs ranging from classic to modern. Whether you&#39;re looking for an elegant French nail design, geometric patterned nails, or embellished painted nails, you&#39;ll find something to suit your unique style.<br><br>\ud83c\udf1f Step by Step Tutorials [COMING SOON]: It has never been easier to create your own stunning manicures. Our detailed tutorials will guide you through the entire process, from nail prep to applying polish and embellishments. It doesn&#39;t matter if you are a beginner or a professional, our tutorials for making gel and semi-permanent ones are for everyone!.\ud83c\udf1f Constant Updates: Every month we update our content so that you have the maximum possible inspiration for your next manicure. Plus, we added more categories so you can find the perfect nail idea. Do you have long, false, semi-permanent, gel or natural nails? Our ideas are suitable for all nail types. Find your category of red, black or white nails, we also have seasons:<br><br>\ud83d\udc85Do you want a nail design for Halloween? We have it! Enjoy dozens of Halloween nail designs.<br>\ud83d\udc85Do you want a nail design for Christmas? We have it! Enjoy hundreds of Christmas nail designs.<br>\ud83d\udc85Do you want a nail design for Weddings or Events? We have it! You enjoy manicure ideas for weddings or events.<br><br>\ud83c\udf1f Expert Tips [COMING SOON]: Do you want to know how to make your manicure last longer? How to make sculpted nails from home? Do you have ingrown or fungal nails? We share our secrets with you, from nail prep to applying a long-lasting top coat.<br><br>\ud83c\udf1f Favorites and Save: Save your favorite designs for future appointments with your manicurist or download the image of the painted nails you like to have them on your phone.<br><br>With our manicure ideas app, your nails become a blank palette to express your style and creativity. Let your imagination run wild and create a new nail look for every occasion, whether it&#39;s a special meeting, a wedding or just a day at work.<br><br>\ud83d\udc85 In addition, we have designs for all types of manicures:<br><br>Ideas for acrylic nails<br>Ideas for gel nails<br>Ideas for long or very long nails (xxl)<br>Ideas for false nails<br>Ideas for natural nails<br>Ideas for short nails<br>Ideas for semi-permanent nails<br><br>\ud83d\udc85And if that were not enough, we have so many categories with inspiration and ideas for manicure that include all this and more:<br><br>Decorated nail designs<br>French nail designs<br>red nail designs<br>black nail designs<br>White nail designs<br>Green nail designs<br>Simple painted nail designs<br>Sculpted nail designs<br><br>\ud83d\udc85Remember to change the design according to the season:<br><br>Nail manicure for Halloween<br>Nail manicure for Christmas<br>Nail manicure for Valentine&#39;s Day<br>Wedding Nail Manicure<br>Nail manicure for baptisms<br><br>Download our app now and discover the infinite world of possibilities for your nails. Make your nails stand out and set the trend with your unique creations \ud83c\udfa8",
